    "format-version": "0.1",
    "license": "MIT",
    "name": "SpatialData QC-to-Communication Pipeline",
    "readme": "# SpatialData QC-to-Communication Pipeline\n\n## Overview\nUnlike raw-data analysis pipelines, this workflow is designed to accept a pre-assembled `SpatialData` object, perform comprehensive single-cell and spatial analysis, and package the rich annotations back into a standardized, interoperable format. It covers the full analytical steps from QC through clustering, spatial statistics, automated cell type annotation, and cell-cell communication inference.\n\n## Inputs\n\n### Primary Data Input\n* **SpatialData Archive**: A unified spatial data object (typically a Zarr archive).\n\n### Element Mapping Parameters\nBecause a `SpatialData` object can bundle several named layers, the workflow asks you to point it at the specific elements it should operate on:\n* **Table association**: The table (AnnData) element to extract for analysis.\n* **Points / Shapes / Image / Channels / Label element names**: Identifiers for the corresponding geometry, imaging, and segmentation-label layers.\n* **Coordinate system**: The spatial coordinate system to align all elements to.\n* **Key specifying volume/area**: The `obs` column holding per-cell volume (used for volume-based QC).\n\n### Analytical Parameters\n* **QC Filtering Options**:\n    * Minimum/Maximum counts per cell.\n    * Minimum/Maximum genes per cell.\n    * Minimum counts and minimum cells per gene.\n    * Proportion of top genes to track for QC metrics.\n    * **Filter data by cell volume?** (boolean) with associated Minimum/Maximum cell volume thresholds.\n* **Subsampling** (optional, for large datasets).\n* **Feature Selection**:\n    * Toggle to select Seurat vs. Cellranger flavor for highly variable gene selection.\n    * `n_top_genes` and an optional `batch_key` for batch-aware HVG selection.\n* **Confounder Removal & Scaling**: Toggles to regress out total counts/volume and to scale the expression matrix.\n* **Clustering & Dimensionality Reduction**: A list of Leiden clustering resolutions to test, plus the **expected number of clusters**. The workflow automatically identifies which resolution in the list yields that target cluster count and uses it downstream.\n* **CellTypist model**: Pre-trained model selection for CellTypist automated annotation.\n\n---\n\n## Outputs\n\n* **`spatialdata_output_processed` (.zip)**: The final, fully enriched `SpatialData` archive, ready for downstream exploration (e.g., Napari).\n* **`initial Anndata table`**: The AnnData extracted at the start of the pipeline, prior to any filtering.\n* **QC & Spatial Plot Panels**:\n    * QC plots / spatial scatter plots — pre-filter\n    * QC plots filtered / spatial scatter plots filtered — after count/gene filtering\n    * QC plots filtered volume / spatial scatter plots filtered volume — after the optional volume filter (only produced when volume filtering is enabled)\n* **`Filtered AnnData table`**: The AnnData after all QC filtering steps.\n* **`Final table info of cells and genes during filtering`**: A running tally of cell/gene counts retained at each filtering stage.\n* **`HVG plot`**: Variance plot from highly-variable-gene selection.\n* **`PCA plot`**\n* **`umap plot - general`**: UMAP colored by default embedding.\n* **`umap plot - leiden res`**: UMAP colored by the automatically selected Leiden resolution (matching the expected cluster count).\n* **`umap plot - leiden res - interactive`**: A Vitessce configuration for interactive, in-browser exploration of the same UMAP/clustering.\n* **`selected resolution`**: File recording which Leiden resolution was chosen.\n* **`ranked_genes table`** and **`scanpy ranked genes plot`**: Marker gene rankings per cluster.\n* **`squidpy plot centrality_score`** and **`squidpy plot nhood_enrichment`**: Spatial network statistics plots.\n* **`celltypist dotplot`**: Summary of automated cell type annotation.\n* **`anndata_out`** (LIANA): AnnData enriched with ligand-receptor interaction results.",
    "report": {
        "markdown": "# SpatialData Analysis Pipeline Workflow Execution Report\n\n> Generated by the Galaxy workflow **\"SpatialData QC-to-Communication Pipeline\"**\n> Automated QC, clustering, spatial statistics, cell type annotation, and cell-cell communication.\n\n## Workflow Inputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_inputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow Outputs\n```galaxy\ninvocation_outputs()\n```\n\n## Workflow\n```galaxy\nworkflow_display()\n```\n\n---\n---\n\n<br>\n## General\n\n### SpatialData Information\nThe input `SpatialData` object used for this run:\n\n<br>\n**basic info:**\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_info(input=\"spatialdata\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**data type**\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_type(input=\"spatialdata\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**dateset peek**\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_peek(input=\"spatialdata\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**name of the dataset**\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_name(input=\"spatialdata\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**link to the dataset**\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_link(input=\"spatialdata\")\n```\n\n<br>\n<br>\n### Table information\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_peek(output=\"initial Anndata table\")\n```\n\n<br>\n<br>\n---\n---\n\n<br>\n## Filtering and HVG selection\n### Quality metrics\n\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"QC plots\")\n```\n\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"spatial scatter plots\")\n```\n\n---\n\n<br>\n### Filtering\n\n<br>\n### Quality metrics after filtering\n\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"QC plots filtered\")\n```\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"spatial scatter plots filtered\")\n```\n\n---\n\n<br>\n### Filtering by cell area\n\n<br>\n### Quality metrics after filtering by cell area\n\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"QC plots filtered volume\")\n```\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"spatial scatter plots filtered volume\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**Number of Genes and Cells after each filtering step**\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"Final table info of cells and genes during filtering\")\n```\n\n---\n\n<br>\n### Highly variable gene selection\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"HVG plot\")\n```\n\n---\n---\n\n<br>\n## Clustering\n\n<br>\n**PCA plot**\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"PCA plot\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**UMAP plot**\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"umap plot - general\")\n```\n\n<br>\n**Leiden clusters**\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"umap plot - leiden res\")\n```\n\n\n```galaxy\nvisualization(visualization_id=vitessce, output=\"umap plot - leiden res - interactive\")\n```\n\n\n<br>\n**Ranked gene list based on Leiden clusters**\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_table(output=\"ranked_genes table\")\n```\n\n<br>\nLink to the table:\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_link(output=\"ranked_genes table\")\n```\n\n<br>\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"scanpy ranked genes plot\")\n```\n\n<br>\n\n\n---\n---\n<br>\n## Squidpy\n\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"squidpy plot centrality_score\")\n```\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output=\"squidpy plot nhood_enrichment\")\n```\n\n---\n---\n\n## Cell Typist\n\n\n```galaxy\nhistory_dataset_as_image(output='celltypist dotplot')\n```\n\n---\n---\n\n## Liana\n"
    },
